                },
                {
                    "sense_id": "210592cb-aba4-3011-a53b-83b8ff698ee9",
                    "sense_definition": "One of the platforms, consisting of two or more planks dowelled together, for the flooring of a temporary military bridge.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The engineers laid each <w>chess</w> carefully to ensure the bridge was stable.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Инженеры тщательно укладывали каждую <w>доску настила</w>, чтобы обеспечить устойчивость моста.",
                                "zh": "工程师们小心地铺设每一块<w>桥面板</w>，以确保桥梁稳固。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Heavy vehicles can cross once the <w>chess</w> is secured over the supports.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
